1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:02,060
(Leonard:)Oh, I don't know.

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:03,660
(Leonard:)Maybe when you walk
into a hotel room

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:06,530
(Leonard:)and you see a guy getting back
together with his girlfriend,

4
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:08,860
(Leonard:)you should consider doing
something other

5
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,330
(Leonard:)than crawling into
the adjoining bed.

6
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:14,370
I did. You said no
Bridget Jones.

7
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:17,110
(Penny(voice):)We weren't getting
back together!

8
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:19,840
(Penny(voice):)It was a one-time thing!

9
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,110
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

10
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:23,080
(Sheldon:)We're not taking comments
or questions

11
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,750
(Sheldon:)from the audience just yet.

12
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:27,250
(Penny(voice):)Oh, shut up, Sheldon!

13
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,450
(Amy:)Hi, bestie.

14
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:30,720
(Amy:)All right,

15
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:33,450
(Sheldon:)why don't we see if we can bring
this back to topic.

16
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,190
(Howard:)Let me ask you
something, Bernie.

17
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:36,590
(Howard:)I guess not.

18
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:39,460
How would you feel if
you met my ex-girlfriend

19
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:42,200
(Howard:)and she was like
Angelina Jolie?

20
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,570
(Bernadette:)Oh, come on, Howard,
be realistic.

21
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:52,440
(Howard:)What, I'm not hot enough
for Angelina Jolie?

22
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:54,640
(Raj:)I'd like to weigh in here.

23
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,180
(Sheldon:)No.

24
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:00,450
(Amy:)All right,
why don't we open it up

